      "reason": "Both complete single lexical cases explicitly bind exact okaiin to ist in the same preserved GDT814 model G. Each source gives the identical conditional f17r.11 clause Diese Wurzel ist äußerst trocken? under the same this/root/dry assumptions and unchanged four-value scalar family. The authored note says N/G are not redefined, and the timing record confirms both inherited models and all seven shared guesses remain unchanged. Retained and unverändert are documentary descriptions of that identical model scope, not separate senses, epochs of meaning or independent full-paragraph propositions. The concrete written-copula construction and remaining unknown subject/context costs agree across the report and authored note. This is a source-defined identity bridge, not an analogy from the FG powder result.",
